#: wayback_filter.module:16
msgid "Access Wayback Filter setup"
msgstr "Adgang til indstillinger af Wayback Filter"

#: wayback_filter.module:17
msgid "Allow user to change settings for Wayback Filter."
msgstr "Tillad at brugeren ændrer i indstillingerne for Wayback Filter"

#: wayback_filter.module:49
msgid "Add Wayback links"
msgstr "Tilføje Wayback links"

#: wayback_filter.module:50
msgid "Add links to pages on Wayback Machine for old articles."
msgstr "Tilføj henvisninger til sider på Wayback Machine for ældre artikler."

#: wayback_filter.module:100
msgid "This link can take you to the Archive.org-version of the page if the original site is dead"
msgstr ""
"Dette link kan føre dig til Archive.org's version af siden, hvis ikke "
"der er noget at se på den oprindelige side"

#: wayback_filter.module:101
msgid "Wayback-link"
msgstr "Wayback-link"

#: wayback_filter.module:115
msgid "Add links to Archive.org's Waybback Machine for URLs on old articles to ensure that the user can see something when pages have died."
msgstr "Tilføj links til Archive.org's Wayback Machine for URL'er på gamle artikler, så brugeren stadig kan se noget når den oprindelig side er død."

#: wayback_filter.module:127;135
msgid "Cutting date"
msgstr "Skæringsdato"

#: wayback_filter.module:127;156
msgid "Relative age"
msgstr "Relativ alder"

#: wayback_filter.module:128
msgid "Cutting date or relative age"
msgstr "Skæringsdato eller relativ alder"

#: wayback_filter.module:130
msgid "Select whether to use cutting date or relative age for the Wayback filter. Set the selected value(s) below."
msgstr "Vælg om der skal bruges en absolut skæringsdato eller en relativ alder til Wyback filtret. Sæt den valgte værdi nedenfor."

#: wayback_filter.module:143
msgid "Cutting date to use for the Wayback filter. Articles older than this date has the filter, younger articles don't."
msgstr "Skæringsdator for Wayback Filter. Artikler ældre end denne dator får Wayback-links, yngre artikler gør ikke."

#: wayback_filter.module:161
msgid "Wayback Filter settings"
msgstr "Indstillinger for Wayback Filter"

#: wayback_filter.module:162
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration"

#: wayback_filter.module:183
msgid "Add links to Archive.org's Wayback Machine for URLs on old articles to ensure that the user can see something when pages have died."
msgstr "Tilføj links til Archive.org's Wayback Machine for URL'er på gamle artikler, så brugeren stadig kan se noget når den oprindelig side er død."

#: wayback_filter.module:250
msgid "Click to see an archived version of the destination page."
msgstr "Klik for at se en arkiveret version af destinationssiden."

#: wayback_filter.module:391
msgid "Enter a Backdrop core icon name, an emoji, or plain text. HTML is not supported."
msgstr "Indtast et Backdrop-kerneikonnavn, en emoji eller almindelig tekst. HTML understøttes ikke."

#: wayback_filter.module:405
msgid "Wayback link behaviour"
msgstr "Wayback-linkadfærd"

#: wayback_filter.module:407
msgid "Append the Wayback Link (recommended)"
msgstr "Tilføj Wayback-linket efter det oprindelige link (anbefalet)"

#: wayback_filter.module:408
msgid "Replace the original link with the Wayback Link"
msgstr "Erstat det oprindelige link med Wayback-linket"

#: wayback_filter.module:411
msgid "Choose whether to add a Wayback link after the original link, or replace the original link entirely."
msgstr "Vælg om der skal tilføjes et Wayback-link efter det oprindelige link, eller om det oprindelige link skal erstattes helt."

#: wayback_filter.module:416
msgid "Icon or text for the Wayback link"
msgstr "Ikon eller tekst til Wayback-linket"

#: wayback_filter.module:420
msgid "Enter a <a href=\"@icon_api\">Backdrop core icon name</a>, an emoji, a Unicode character, or plain text. HTML is not supported.<br />Recommended icons from <em>core/misc/icons</em>: <strong>archive</strong>, <strong>clock-counter-clockwise</strong>, <strong>rewind</strong>, or <strong>hourglass</strong>. <br />Alternatively, you can use emojis like <a href=\"@classical_building\">🏛️</a> (classical building), <a href=\"@floppy\">💾</a> (floppy disk), or <a href=\"@circlearrow\">⟲</a> (circle arrow)."
msgstr "Indtast et <a href=\"@icon_api\">Backdrop-kerneikonnavn</a>, en emoji, et Unicode-tegn eller almindelig tekst. HTML understøttes ikke.<br />Anbefalede ikoner fra <em>core/misc/icons</em>: <strong>archive</strong>, <strong>clock-counter-clockwise</strong>, <strong>rewind</strong> eller <strong>hourglass</strong>. <br />Alternativt kan du bruge emojis som <a href=\"@classical_building\">🏛️</a> (klassisk bygning), <a href=\"@floppy\">💾</a> (diskette) eller <a href=\"@circlearrow\">⟲</a> (cirkelpil)."

#: wayback_filter.module:429
msgid "Link title for the Wayback link"
msgstr "Linktitel for Wayback-linket"

#: wayback_filter.module:432
msgid "This is what desktop users get to read when their cursor hovers over the Wayback link."
msgstr "Dette er teksten desktopbrugere ser, når markøren holdes over Wayback-linket."

#: wayback_filter.module:437
msgid "Place Wayback links on nodes older than..."
msgstr "Placer Wayback-links på indhold ældre end..."

#: wayback_filter.module:442
msgid "Nodes older than this many years will get a trailing Wayback link. Set to 0 to show on all articles."
msgstr "Indhold ældre end dette antal år får et efterfølgende Wayback-link. Sæt til 0 for at vise på alle artikler."

#: wayback_filter.module:449
msgid "Preview of a link with a trailing Wayback link"
msgstr "Forhåndsvisning af et link med et efterfølgende Wayback-link"

#: wayback_filter.module:454
msgid "Advanced help"
msgstr "Avanceret hjælp"

#: wayback_filter.module:454
msgid "Most people will be able to see emojis and Unicode characters, even if they differ a bit between platforms. Only desktop users will be able to see the link title and only when their cursor hovers over the Wayback link. The Wayback link can be styled by adding styles to the CSS class <em>wayback-link</em> (for example, <em>.wayback-link {font-size: 0.8rem; color: red;}</em> somewhere in your stylesheet will make the Wayback link small and red). HTML is not supported in the icon field.<br />If you wish to paste actual emojis into any of the above fields, you should make sure that your database is <a href=\"@utf8mb4\">utf8mb4</a>. Since you are running this on a Backdrop site, it probably is.<br><br>"
msgstr "De fleste vil kunne se emojis og Unicode-tegn, selv om de kan se lidt forskellige ud på tværs af platforme. Kun desktopbrugere kan se linktitlen, og kun når markøren holdes over Wayback-linket. Wayback-linket kan styles ved at tilføje CSS til klassen <em>wayback-link</em> (for eksempel vil <em>.wayback-link {font-size: 0.8rem; color: red;}</em> et sted i dit stylesheet gøre Wayback-linket lille og rødt). HTML understøttes ikke i ikonfeltet.<br />Hvis du vil indsætte faktiske emojis i et af felterne ovenfor, bør du sikre dig, at din database er <a href=\"@utf8mb4\">utf8mb4</a>. Da du kører på et Backdrop-site, er den det sandsynligvis.<br><br>"

#: wayback_filter.module:458
msgid "<strong>Nice to know</strong><br>The Wayback Filter works only in view mode <em>full</em>. The filter looks at the created date of the node, and tries to find the closest match at archive.org. That is: if your node was created on christmas morning 2011, it will link to the christmas morning 2011 versions of the link destination pages. Do they exist? Often they do. Give or take some days or weeks. If you want to be absolutely sure that archived versions of your link destination exists, use <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/\">the relevant browser extension at the Wayback Machine</a> (look under <em>Tools</em>) to produce an 1-click archived version."
msgstr "<strong>Godt at vide</strong><br>Wayback Filter fungerer kun i visningstilstanden <em>full</em>. Filteret ser på indholdets oprettelsesdato og forsøger at finde det nærmeste match på archive.org. Det betyder: hvis dit indhold blev oprettet julemorgen 2011, vil det linke til versioner af linkmålene fra julemorgen 2011. Findes de? Ofte gør de. Plus/minus nogle dage eller uger. Hvis du vil være helt sikker på, at arkiverede versioner af dine linkmål findes, så brug <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/\">den relevante browserudvidelse fra Wayback Machine</a> (se under <em>Tools</em>) til at oprette en arkiveret version med ét klik."

#: wayback_filter.module:462
msgid "Note: Most people are satisfied with <a href=\"@url\">adding Wayback Links to text formats using the Configure-button</a>"
msgstr "Bemærk: De fleste er tilfredse med <a href=\"@url\">at tilføje Wayback-links til tekstformater via knappen Konfigurer</a>"

#: wayback_filter.module:462
msgid "You should probably do it right after you have saved this form.<br>Yet...If you want to add Wayback Links to a host of different link fields, go ahead:"
msgstr "Du bør sandsynligvis gøre det lige efter, at du har gemt denne formular.<br>Men... hvis du vil tilføje Wayback-links til en række forskellige linkfelter, så fortsæt bare:"

#: wayback_filter.module:470
msgid "Experimental: Field Names"
msgstr "Eksperimentelt: Feltnavne"

#: wayback_filter.module:472
msgid "Enter the machine names of the fields to apply the filter. One per line. I.e.<br><em>field_link</em><br><em>field_url</em><br>- For every <a href=\"@url\">content type</a> you can press <em>Manage fields</em> to get a list of <em>Machine names</em>. Yes, these are the names you should use here."
msgstr "Indtast maskinnavnene på de felter, hvor filteret skal bruges. Ét navn pr. linje, f.eks.<br><em>field_link</em><br><em>field_url</em><br>- For hver <a href=\"@url\">indholdstype</a> kan du klikke på <em>Administrer felter</em> for at få en liste over <em>maskinnavne</em>. Ja, det er disse navne, du skal bruge her."

